OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow Subway to shut on two
OL,4,ASundays for systems tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow's Subway is to close for two
OL,7,FSundays later this month to allow
OL,8,Ftesting for its new signalling,
OL,9,Fcommunications, and operational
OL,10,Fsystems.
OL,12,FThe planned closures will be on Sunday
OL,13,F15 November and Sunday 22 November -
OL,14,Fwith Glasgow's M8 motorway also partly
OL,15,Fclosed on the first weekend.
OL,17,FPeople are being advised to allow extra
OL,18,Ftime for journeys around the city.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
