OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow Subway to shut on two
OL,4,ASundays for systems tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrathclyde Partnership for Transport
OL,7,F(SPT) has been modernising Subway
OL,8,Foperations in recent months, including
OL,9,Fhaving moved many operations to a new
OL,10,Fcontrol room at the end of August.
